              </p>
              <div class="opts three">
                <div class="opt rec">
                  <div class="top"><span class="tag rec">Check this first</span><h4>Use what you already pay for</h4></div>
                  <p>
                    <a href="https://clubcaddie.com/solutions/customer-management/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Club Caddie&rsquo;s customer management</a> already does customer profiles, purchase and playing history, grouping by member type, and email through <a href="https://mailchimp.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mailchimp</a> with 12,000 messages a month included. One support ticket would tell us whether it can take a lead from the website.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="opt alt">
                  <div class="top"><span class="tag alt">Low effort</span><h4>Off the shelf</h4></div>
                  <p>
                    Send the form into <a href="https://www.airtable.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Airtable</a> or <a href="https://www.hubspot.com/products/crm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HubSpot&rsquo;s free CRM</a>. A working list quickly, nothing custom, no dependency on me.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="opt alt">
                  <div class="top"><span class="tag alt">Worth exploring</span><h4>Built into your site</h4></div>
